<div class="button-view">
    <div id="stake-infos" class="stake-infos">
        <p class="descr">Funds distributed by project are accumulated for each token, all the time. For accumuluation, there is no need to stake the token. However if a token holder want's to get to his part of the accumulated funds, tokens need to be staked.</p>
        <p class="descr">When staked, user will get 90% of accumulated funds, basically as a 0 % loan. Tokens are no longer in users ownership, to get them back, unstake must happen.</p>
        <p class="descr">If some tokens are staked, user got his funds in the past and in a meantime additional funds were added, staking 0 more tokens will get him those additional funds</p>
        <p class="descr">Example: total funds are 100, user stakes 10% of total allocation, receives 9(90% of 10% of total funds) funds. Later:total funds are 200, user receives additional 9 funds, while staking 0 more tokens.(90% of 10% of total added funds). Staking additional tokens will always result in receiving funds in full - tokens already received. </p>
        <p class="separator"></p>
        <p>Tokens you hold, you staked, GWEI you received </p>
        <p>
            <div id="balance-container" style="display: flex;">
            <span id="total-balance"></span>
            <span id="already-staked"></span>
            <span id="already-borrowed"></span>
        </div>
        </p>

        <p>(RE)STAKE all and stake <span><input type="number"  pattern="^\d*(\.\d{0,2})?$" id="stake-input" value="0" step="0.00001"/></span> more</span></p>
        <p style="padding: 30px;">
            you will get
            <span id="restake-amount-display"> </span> GWEI
        </p>
        <p style="padding: 30px;">
            <a id="stake-execute-button" href="#" class="button">let's do it</a>
        </p>
    </div>

</div>

<script src="scriptsStake.js"></script>
<script>
    // Create an object to store token details mapped to token addresses
    window.tokenDetails = {
        tokenAddress: '<%= tokenDetails.tokenAddress %>',
        registryAddress: '<%= tokenDetails.registryAddress %>',
        name: '<%= tokenDetails.name %>',
        decimals: '<%= tokenDetails.decimals %>',
        symbol: '<%= tokenDetails.symbol %>',
        decimals: '<%= tokenDetails.decimals %>',
        logoPath: '<%= tokenDetails.logoPath %>',
        totalFunds: '<%=  tokenDetails.totalFunds %>',
        totalSupply: '<%=  tokenDetails.totalSupply %>',
    }
</script>